{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e19-scene-02",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "提议召回总制作人  (Proposing to Recall the Chief Producer)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "kaiwen": "凯文"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Welcome to Episode 19 of Behind the Scenes. When Xingtian's chairwoman visits the editorial office to commend the team for resolving the false-ad crisis, Bu Xiaogu seizes the moment to ask for Chun Yuqiao's return. Listen to Xiaogu and Kaiwen in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "董事长，现在可以证明我之前说过的话了吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "星天总编室团队，确实是业内最有能力的团队。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "董事长，杏子姐和凯文哥，我们能力确实不差。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "但是我认为，这次危机处理得这么成功，原因不止如此。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "它证明的不是我们的能力，而是淳于总留下的流程价值。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "董事长，现在是不是可以提议董事会了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "把我们的总制作人召回来了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "公事私事全搞定了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大这才离开多久啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "苦心人，天不负。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这就叫向死而生！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "明天一定会有好消息的。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "董事长，现在可以证明我之前说过的话了吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chairwoman, does this now prove what I told you earlier?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "星天总编室团队，确实是业内最有能力的团队。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xingtian's chief editor team truly is the most capable team in the industry.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "董事长，杏子姐和凯文哥，我们能力确实不差。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chairwoman, Sister Xingzi, Brother Kaiwen, and I are certainly capable.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "但是我认为，这次危机处理得这么成功，原因不止如此。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'However, I think there is a deeper reason why this crisis was handled so successfully.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "它证明的不是我们的能力，而是淳于总留下的流程价值。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What it proves is not our ability, rather the value of the workflow Mr Chun Yuqiao left behind.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "董事长，现在是不是可以提议董事会了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chairwoman, can you now put a proposal before the board of directors?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "把我们的总制作人召回来了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Can we recall our chief producer back to the company?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "公事私事全搞定了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Both the official crisis and our personal mission are completely settled!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大这才离开多久啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Just look how briefly the boss has been away!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "苦心人，天不负。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Heaven never lets down those who pour their hearts into trying.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这就叫向死而生！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That is what you call fighting back from the brink!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "明天一定会有好消息的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Tomorrow is sure to bring good news.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "董事长，现在可以证明我之前说过的话了吧？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "星天总编室团队，确实是业内最有能力的团队。",
      "gap": 0.5
